               <p xml:id="idm116">"Sganarels Reise til det philosophiske Land" is one of Holberg's last comedies. It had it's first performance at The Royal Theatre in Copenhagen in 1751. It is set in an imaginative country far from the Danish everyday life, but the moral is typical Holberg: unworldly scholarliness is always ridiculous and useless, sometimes even harmful.</p>
